                <pb facs="0121" n="33" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg33"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">710.G/299: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Weddell</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-10-25T15:00:00-05:00">October 25, 1933—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>78. Your 97, October 24, 1 p.m. Please endeavor to ascertain exactly what is in
                    the Foreign Minister’s mind regarding postponement and cable report.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
